ate.","q2":"Can I ask about delivery?","a2":"Share the delivery location and your preferred date in your enquiry. Delivery options and timing are confirmed for your request.","q3":"How are delivery charges confirmed?","a3":"Any delivery charge is confirmed for your request. Share the delivery location so we can discuss the details.","q4":"Can I request a preferred date or time?","a4":"Include your preferred date and time in your enquiry. Availability and timing are confirmed in conversation.","q5":"Can I discuss a custom bouquet?","a5":"Share your ideas, preferred colours and any inspiration for your bouquet so we can discuss the details.","q6":"Can I enquire about an event?","a6":"Tell us about your wedding, private event or collaboration, including the location and preferred date, so we can discuss your ideas.","q7":"What information should I send?","a7":"Start with the occasion, location and preferred date. You can also share your ideas, budget and any extras you would like to discuss."}